# Vercel does not run our Python builder — the HTML is pre-built
# and committed. Anything below is source-only and never served,
# so excluding it from every deployment upload shrinks the
# deployment-storage footprint.

# Source markdown (the built .html at root is what serves)
content/

# Build script + its scratch files
_build.py

# Repo docs
RESTORE_POINTS.md
README.md
CLAUDE.md

# Editor / OS junk that occasionally slips into a repo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
